00:00:00,112 --> 00:00:00,550
Part two.

2
00:00:00,975 --> 00:00:02,050
The debt behind the boom.

3
00:00:02,462 --> 00:00:04,012
AI keeps getting cheaper to use.

4
00:00:04,438 --> 00:00:06,825
But Cuban says that's partly because the companies

5
00:00:06,838 --> 00:00:09,125
building it keep borrowing and spending to buy

6
00:00:09,138 --> 00:00:10,712
more power and more chips.

7
00:00:11,138 --> 00:00:12,538
The giant cloud companies,

8
00:00:12,688 --> 00:00:14,212
the so-called hyperscalers,

9
00:00:14,575 --> 00:00:14,912
are,

10
00:00:15,288 --> 00:00:16,050
in his words,

11
00:00:16,325 --> 00:00:17,788
borrowing more than they're making.

12
00:00:18,238 --> 00:00:20,162
He thinks Meta is borrowing more than its

13
00:00:20,175 --> 00:00:20,888
cash flow.

14
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:22,525
And he says Nvidia,

15
00:00:22,912 --> 00:00:24,600
